# No environment variables or API keys are required.
# Use npm run dev:review for the all-open local review preview.
# Normal builds always use the December 2026 unlock dates.
# There is no URL parameter or environment variable to bypass production dates.
# The separate team-review Preview branch is configured in team-review.config.json.
# Optional server-side kill switch for future team-review builds (then redeploy):
# TEAM_REVIEW_ENABLED=false
# See TEAM_REVIEW.md for deleting old, already published review deployments.
